Exceutor Memory Management : 

JVM Heap Memory:

OFF- heap memory:
Default to 0, will not be handled by JVM

Overhead Memory:
10% of memory

Pyspark memory:
Default to 0, will not be handled by JVM

Common Executor OOM causes:
large Shuffle Join
Skewed data
to many cached dataframes
Large Broadcast join

Best Practices:

Right partition size
Aviod wide transformations
use AQE
optimize delta tables
